{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，毛伯來求金。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"毛伯者何？天子之大夫也。何以不稱使？當喪未君也。踰年矣，何以謂之未君？即位矣，而未稱王也。未稱王，何以知其即位？以諸侯之踰年即位，亦知天子之踰年即位也。以天子三年然後稱王，亦知諸侯於其封內三年稱子也，踰年稱公矣。則曷為於其封內三年稱子？緣民臣之心不可一日無君，緣終始之義，一年不二君，不可曠年無君。緣孝子之心，則三年不忍當也。毛伯來求金，何以書？譏。何譏爾？王者無求，求金非禮也。然則是王者與？曰：非也。非王者則曷為謂之王者？王者無求，曰：是子也。繼文王之體，守文王之法度，文王之法無求，而求，故譏之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"二、夫人姜氏如齊。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"三、二月，叔孫得臣如京師。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"四、辛丑，葬襄王。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"王者不書葬，此何以書？不及時書，過時書，我有往者則書。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"五、晉人殺其大夫先都。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"六、三月，夫人姜氏至自齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"七、晉人殺其大夫縠及箕鄭父。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"八、楚人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"九、公子遂會晉人、宋人、衞人、許人救鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十、夏，狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十一、秋八月，曹伯襄卒。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十二、九月癸酉，地震。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"地震者何？動地也。何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十三、冬，楚子使椒來聘。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_17","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"椒者何？楚大夫也。楚無大夫，此何以書？始有大夫也。始有大夫，則何以不氏？許夷狄者不一而足也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_18","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十四、秦人來歸僖公成風之襚。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_19","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"其言僖公成風何？兼之。兼之非禮也。曷為不言及成風？成風尊也。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_cdt_105_20","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_105","textTraditional":"十五、葬曹共公。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}